{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52252","headline":"诗（幷序） 十三 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"富者办棺木，贫穷席裹（一作「里」）角。\n相共唱奈河（周校作「何」），送着空塚各（项校作「阁」）。\n千休即万休，永别生平乐。\n志（张改作「智」）者入西方，愚人堕地狱。\n掇（一作「{扌鵽}」，黄、项校作「缀」）头入苦海，冥冥不省觉。\n擎头乡里行，事当逞靴袄。\n有钱但着用，莫作千年调。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}